    "title" : "14 Dining Road- Niseko Real Estate Photographer ",
    "sourceUrl" : "",
    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1730891045568\" id=\"item-672b352b9e1f4315654aaca4\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-478cee6d240f92452381\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>About us:</strong> </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Property Media Japan specializes in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floorplans and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Key features</strong> :</p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Four Generous Bedrooms</strong>: Each bedroom is designed to maximize comfort, with abundant natural light and quality finishes that create a relaxing atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Two Stylish Bathrooms</strong>: The bathrooms feature contemporary fixtures and a fresh, streamlined design, ensuring a daily retreat-like experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Expansive Living Area</strong>: This central space connects seamlessly to the kitchen and dining areas, creating a flow that\u2019s perfect for modern family life.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Single-Car Garage</strong>: The attached garage provides secure parking and extra storage space.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Outdoor Living</strong>: Enjoy a beautifully landscaped backyard and patio, ideal for outdoor dining or simply unwinding with friends and family.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Built with a focus on quality and sustainability, 14 Dining Road is perfectly positioned for convenient access to local amenities, parks, and schools, offering an ideal blend of serenity and accessibility. Whether you\u2019re a growing family or a professional couple, this home provides the space, style, and convenience for an elevated lifestyle in Auckland.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;floatDir&quot;:null,&quot;methodOption&quot;:&quot;transient&quot;,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:null,&quot;auto-crop&quot;:true,&quot;blockAnimation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;collectionId&quot;:&quot;672b35e81166524fec4af2e1&quot;,&quot;design&quot;:&quot;stacked&quot;,&quot;show-meta&quot;:true,&quot;show-meta-basic&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-title&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-description&quot;:false,&quot;square-thumbs&quot;:true,&quot;vSize&quot;:null,&quot;transientGalleryId&quot;:&quot;672b35e81166524fec4af2e1&quot;&#125;\" data-block-type=\"8\" data-sqsp-block=\"gallery\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1730782483469_345214\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"\n  sqs-gallery-container\n  sqs-gallery-block-stacked\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  block-animation-none\n  clear\"\n  \n  \n>\n  <div class=\"sqs-gallery\">\n    \n      \n        \n          <div class=\"image-wrapper\" id=\"672b36029e1f4315654ada60\" data-type=\"image\" data-animation-role=\"image\">\n            \n              <noscript><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1730885147174-M9F56SY7CAXYCL2RHEHD/14+Dining+Dusk+Auckland+Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer+%285%29.jpg\" alt=\"14 Dining Dusk